#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""rose — one launcher for several Claude Code and Codex CLI accounts.

Design follows codexx (https://github.com/JoRo-Code/codexx, MIT):
  * every account has its own home (CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR / CODEX_HOME), so logins,
    history and sessions never mix;
  * non-secret config (settings, CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md, skills, plugins,
    config.toml ...) is symlinked from ~/.claude and ~/.codex and edited once;
  * chats can be moved to another account and resumed there, manually
    (`rose move`, `rose resume --to`) or when an account hits its usage limit
    (failover mode: off / ask / auto).

Python 3.9+, macOS/Linux, no dependencies.
"""
